1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,600
A legal answer can sound perfect and still
cite a law that does not exist.

2
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:05,600
Watch Article 1471.

3
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:09,920
The hallucination trap sends one UAE law
question through two paths.

4
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:13,440
Left is a visibly cached, ungrounded model
run.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Right retrieves and ranks official law,
then can cite only retrieved articles.

6
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:20,480
A building collapses eight years after
delivery.

7
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:23,200
Both answers stream, and there it is, red.

8
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:25,600
This law ends at Article 1422.

9
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:28,480
Article 1471 is fabricated.

10
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:31,920
The grounded path cites Article 821.

11
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:35,600
Green proves the exact law, year, and
article exist.

12
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:38,400
It does not automatically prove every
conclusion.

13
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:41,760
The card shows the official excerpt and
exact source link.

14
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:44,240
Across 50 checked questions,

15
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:47,600
90% precision, 88.24% recall,

16
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:51,200
and 0 of 84 real citations falsely marked
fabricated.

17
00:00:51,360 --> 00:00:52,800
Fluent is not defensible.

18
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:55,120
Every citation should survive the record.
